---
layout: null
permalink: /season-starts.ics
---
{%- comment -%}
A subscribable calendar with every food's season starts: one all-day event
per ring on the first day of each fully-in-season run, repeating yearly
(_includes/ics-events.html). Dates are computed from the build year; the
yearly rule keeps them valid afterwards. Each food has a calendar of its
own too, at /remind/<slug>.ics.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign year = site.time | date: "%Y" -%}
{%- assign jan1 = year | append: "-01-01" | date: "%s" | plus: 0 %}
BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Is It Rhubarb Yet//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
X-WR-CALNAME:UK seasons
{% for food in site.data.foods -%}
{% include ics-events.html food=food jan1=jan1 -%}
{% endfor -%}
END:VCALENDAR
